The street is wide and busy.
Suddenly, I hear music.
Someone is playing the guitar.
The music comes from a side street.
I have time today.
I go to the right into the small street.
The music is really beautiful.
I follow the music.
I continue straight ahead and then to the left.
The streets are very quiet now.
There are no people here.
Suddenly the music stops.
It is completely quiet.
Where am I?
I do not know this street.
I see no museums.
I do not know the way to the museum anymore.
I need help.
